[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/q3o.png#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/q3o.png#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 5737 × 3094 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 5737 × 3094 -->\n\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://chat.qwenlm.ai","label":"QWEN CHAT","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://chat.qwenlm.ai\" label=\"QWEN CHAT\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-omni-68d100a86cd0906843ceccbe","label":"HUGGING FACE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-omni-68d100a86cd0906843ceccbe\" label=\"HUGGING FACE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Omni-867aef131e7d4f","label":"MODELSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Omni-867aef131e7d4f\" label=\"MODELSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-omni","label":"DASHSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-omni\" label=\"DASHSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-Omni","label":"GITHUB","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-Omni\" label=\"GITHUB\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-Omni/tree/main/assets/Qwen3_Omni.pdf","label":"PAPER","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-Omni/tree/main/assets/Qwen3_Omni.pdf\" label=\"PAPER\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Omni-Demo","label":"HUGGING FACE DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Omni-Demo\" label=\"HUGGING FACE DEMO\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/studios/Qwen/Qwen3-Omni-Demo","label":"MODELSCOPE DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/studios/Qwen/Qwen3-Omni-Demo\" label=\"MODELSCOPE DEMO\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**Qwen3-Omni** is the natively end-to-end multilingual omni model. It processes text, images, audio, and video, and delivers real-time streaming responses in both text and natural speech. We introduce several upgrades to improve performance and efficiency.","text":"**Qwen3-Omni** is the natively end-to-end multilingual omni model. It processes text, images, audio, and video, and delivers real-time streaming responses in both text and natural speech. We introduce several upgrades to improve performance and efficiency.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Omni**","text":"Qwen3-Omni","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Omni","text":"Qwen3-Omni","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" is the natively end-to-end multilingual omni model. It processes text, images, audio, and video, and delivers real-time streaming responses in both text and natural speech. We introduce several upgrades to improve performance and efficiency.","text":" is the natively end-to-end multilingual omni model. It processes text, images, audio, and video, and delivers real-time streaming responses in both text and natural speech. We introduce several upgrades to improve performance and efficiency.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"* **Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**: Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.\n\n* **Powerful Performance**: Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.\n\n* **Multilingual Support**: Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech\nunderstanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. \n\n* **Faster Response**: Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.\n\n* **Longer Understanding**: Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.\n\n* **Personalized Customization**: Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.\n\n* **Tool Calling**: Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. \n\n* **Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**: Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":true,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**: Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**: Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**: Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.\n","text":"**Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**: Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining**","text":"Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining","text":"Natively Omni-Modal Pretraining","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.","text":": Qwen3-Omni is a natively end-to-end multilingual omni model, without performance degradation compared to the single modality models.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Powerful Performance**: Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Powerful Performance**: Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Powerful Performance**: Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.\n","text":"**Powerful Performance**: Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Powerful Performance**","text":"Powerful Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Powerful Performance","text":"Powerful Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","text":": Qwen3-Omni achieves SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22 across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Multilingual Support**: Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech\nunderstanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. \n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Multilingual Support**: Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech\nunderstanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. \n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Multilingual Support**: Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech\n\nunderstanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. \n","text":"**Multilingual Support**: Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech\nunderstanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. ","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multilingual Support**","text":"Multilingual Support","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multilingual Support","text":"Multilingual Support","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech","text":": Qwen3-Omni supports text interaction in 119 languages, speech","escaped":false},{"type":"br","raw":"\n"},{"type":"text","raw":"understanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. ","text":"understanding in 19 languages, and speech generation in 10 languages. ","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Faster Response**: Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Faster Response**: Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Faster Response**: Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.\n","text":"**Faster Response**: Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Faster Response**","text":"Faster Response","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Faster Response","text":"Faster Response","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.","text":": Qwen3-Omni achieves a latency as low as 211ms in audio-only scenarios and a latency as low as 507ms in audio–video scenarios.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Longer Understanding**: Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Longer Understanding**: Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Longer Understanding**: Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.\n","text":"**Longer Understanding**: Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Longer Understanding**","text":"Longer Understanding","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Longer Understanding","text":"Longer Understanding","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.","text":": Qwen3-Omni supports audio understanding of up to 30 minutes.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Personalized Customization**: Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Personalized Customization**: Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Personalized Customization**: Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.\n","text":"**Personalized Customization**: Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Personalized Customization**","text":"Personalized Customization","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Personalized Customization","text":"Personalized Customization","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.","text":": Qwen3-Omni can be freely adapted via system prompts to modify response styles, personas, and behavioral attributes.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Tool Calling**: Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. \n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Tool Calling**: Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. \n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Tool Calling**: Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. \n","text":"**Tool Calling**: Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. ","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Tool Calling**","text":"Tool Calling","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Tool Calling","text":"Tool Calling","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. ","text":": Qwen3-Omni supports function call, enabling seamless integration with external tools and services. ","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**: Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**: Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**: Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","text":"**Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**: Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner**","text":"Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner","text":"Open-Source Universal Audio Captioner","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","text":": Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B-Captioner, a low-hallucination yet highly detailed universal audio caption model, fills the gap in the open-source community.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<body class=\"body\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_zdOrPju4_g\"\n      style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 900px; height: 510px; \"\n      allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n      allowfullscreen>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<body class=\"body\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_zdOrPju4_g\"\n      style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 900px; height: 510px; \"\n      allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n      allowfullscreen>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Architecture\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Architecture","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Architecture","text":"Architecture","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Omni adopts the Thinker-Talker architecture. Thinker is tasked with text generation while Talker focuses on generating streaming speech tokens by receives high-level representations directly from Thinker. To achieve ultra–low-latency streaming, Talker autoregressively predicts a multi-codebook sequence. At each decoding step, an MTP module outputs the residual codebooks for the current frame, after which the Code2Wav renderer incrementally synthesizes the corresponding waveform, enabling frame-by-frame streaming generation.","text":"Qwen3-Omni adopts the Thinker-Talker architecture. Thinker is tasked with text generation while Talker focuses on generating streaming speech tokens by receives high-level representations directly from Thinker. To achieve ultra–low-latency streaming, Talker autoregressively predicts a multi-codebook sequence. At each decoding step, an MTP module outputs the residual codebooks for the current frame, after which the Code2Wav renderer incrementally synthesizes the corresponding waveform, enabling frame-by-frame streaming generation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Omni adopts the Thinker-Talker architecture. Thinker is tasked with text generation while Talker focuses on generating streaming speech tokens by receives high-level representations directly from Thinker. To achieve ultra–low-latency streaming, Talker autoregressively predicts a multi-codebook sequence. At each decoding step, an MTP module outputs the residual codebooks for the current frame, after which the Code2Wav renderer incrementally synthesizes the corresponding waveform, enabling frame-by-frame streaming generation.","text":"Qwen3-Omni adopts the Thinker-Talker architecture. Thinker is tasked with text generation while Talker focuses on generating streaming speech tokens by receives high-level representations directly from Thinker. To achieve ultra–low-latency streaming, Talker autoregressively predicts a multi-codebook sequence. At each decoding step, an MTP module outputs the residual codebooks for the current frame, after which the Code2Wav renderer incrementally synthesizes the corresponding waveform, enabling frame-by-frame streaming generation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li><p><strong>Innovative Architecture Design</strong></p><p>AuT: The audio encoder adopts the AuT, trained on 20 million hours of audio data, providing extremely strong general audio representation capability.</p><p>MoE: Both the Thinker and Talker adopt MoE architectures to support high concurrency and fast inference.</p><p>Multi-Codebook: The Talker adopts a multi-codebook autoregressive scheme that the Talker generates one codec frame per step, while the MTP module produces the remaining residual codebooks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Non-Degradation Across Modalities</strong></p><p>Mixing unimodal and cross-modal data during the early stage of text pretraining can achieve parity across all modalities—i.e., no modality-specific performance degradation—while markedly enhancing cross-modal capabilities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Excellent Spoken Dialogue and Instruction Following</strong></p><p>Qwen3-Omni achieves Gemini-2.5-Pro-level performance in speech recognition and instruction following tasks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Real-Time Audio and Audiovisual Interaction</strong></p><p>Substantial latency reduction across the entire pipeline—from encoders to Thinker, Talker, and Code2Wav—enables fully streaming generation, with enabling streaming from the first codec frame.</p></li></ul>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li><p><strong>Innovative Architecture Design</strong></p><p>AuT: The audio encoder adopts the AuT, trained on 20 million hours of audio data, providing extremely strong general audio representation capability.</p><p>MoE: Both the Thinker and Talker adopt MoE architectures to support high concurrency and fast inference.</p><p>Multi-Codebook: The Talker adopts a multi-codebook autoregressive scheme that the Talker generates one codec frame per step, while the MTP module produces the remaining residual codebooks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Non-Degradation Across Modalities</strong></p><p>Mixing unimodal and cross-modal data during the early stage of text pretraining can achieve parity across all modalities—i.e., no modality-specific performance degradation—while markedly enhancing cross-modal capabilities.</p></li><li><p><strong>Excellent Spoken Dialogue and Instruction Following</strong></p><p>Qwen3-Omni achieves Gemini-2.5-Pro-level performance in speech recognition and instruction following tasks.</p></li><li><p><strong>Real-Time Audio and Audiovisual Interaction</strong></p><p>Substantial latency reduction across the entire pipeline—from encoders to Thinker, Talker, and Code2Wav—enables fully streaming generation, with enabling streaming from the first codec frame.</p></li></ul>\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/overview.png#center","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/overview.png#center\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Performance\n\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Performance","text":"Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-Omni, which matches the performance of same-sized single-modal models within the Qwen series and excels particularly on audio tasks. Across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, Qwen3-Omni achieves open-\nsource SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","text":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-Omni, which matches the performance of same-sized single-modal models within the Qwen series and excels particularly on audio tasks. Across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, Qwen3-Omni achieves open-\nsource SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-Omni, which matches the performance of same-sized single-modal models within the Qwen series and excels particularly on audio tasks. Across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, Qwen3-Omni achieves open-","text":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-Omni, which matches the performance of same-sized single-modal models within the Qwen series and excels particularly on audio tasks. Across 36 audio and audio-visual benchmarks, Qwen3-Omni achieves open-","escaped":false},{"type":"br","raw":"\n"},{"type":"text","raw":"source SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","text":"source SOTA on 32 benchmarks and overall SOTA on 22, outperforming strong closed-source models such as Gemini-2.5-Pro, Seed-ASR, and GPT-4o-Transcribe.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/qwen3-omni-flash-table.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/qwen3-omni-flash-table.jpg#center\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/qwen3-omni-30a3-table.jpg#center","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Omni/qwen3-omni-30a3-table.jpg#center\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## What's Next\n\n","depth":2,"text":"What's Next","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"What's Next","text":"What's Next","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We are eager to hear your feedback and see the innovative applications you create with Qwen3-Omni. In the near future, we will further advance the model along multiple axes, including multi-speaker ASR, video OCR, audio–video proactive learning, and enhance support for agent-based workflows and function calling.","text":"We are eager to hear your feedback and see the innovative applications you create with Qwen3-Omni. In the near future, we will further advance the model along multiple axes, including multi-speaker ASR, video OCR, audio–video proactive learning, and enhance support for agent-based workflows and function calling.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We are eager to hear your feedback and see the innovative applications you create with Qwen3-Omni. In the near future, we will further advance the model along multiple axes, including multi-speaker ASR, video OCR, audio–video proactive learning, and enhance support for agent-based workflows and function calling.","text":"We are eager to hear your feedback and see the innovative applications you create with Qwen3-Omni. In the near future, we will further advance the model along multiple axes, including multi-speaker ASR, video OCR, audio–video proactive learning, and enhance support for agent-based workflows and function calling.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n\n"}]